#+TITLE: Footers: one row per skill
#+STARTUP: showall

Read by bin/ft1mt, which mints each skill's footer from this table and conventions/house.env.
Edit a row's /spine/ or /how/ by hand if it is wrong; ft1mt keeps /version/, /from/, /revised/ and
/body/ up to date itself (a skill is re-dated only when its body changes).  /how/: mint (ft1mt
writes the footer), recipe (the skill's own literate recipe writes it), verbatim (someone else's
bytes, kept whole).  /spine from/ says where the spine date was found.

